{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02385","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 八 · 韦渠牟","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上法杳无营，玄修似有情。\n道宫琼作想，真帝玉爲名。\n召岳驱旌节，驰雷发吏兵。\n云车降何处，斋室有仙卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}